": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75210393_852485259855759_6019629505745872437_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=M6P4a084dvoQ7kNvwESQmo2&_nc_oc=AdpZgAdzulnBPusvbXDopC_bB24FFpxaF-1IP2LXPebvrKkMlhnZFKYME0k4htKr7LI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQFpHglTBP_HW1B4iJV9ZNeK24JuNXlC5ePeKkhuWKpudQ&oe=6A7B105B"}, {"file_name": "sc1.png", "id": "1698965373936946", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982551_1698965377270279_7553645442698234559_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Eeepp-s2rW8Q7kNvwE81Wmm&_nc_oc=AdqEu2wcP-iN-BVSmxbEhtvvBqS4I-yI52jCbs3FDU2oJTy_XK9rtcUsg0ABjjDpGjQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQFKqGY1B1tpXMr1Q2GrCGZfYYGiyt0nAIOwrUiNjOYVVw&oe=6A7B38E1"}, {"file_name": "sc3.png", "id": "362227642863079", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75312297_362227646196412_4627867009706605201_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=VfgH6Z9ITdIQ7kNvwE5iOpH&_nc_oc=AdrlnSUbVdKfMgor0VjC--rZG9F-CRbTEmnjP8J_K5rz2FNfdnmM_VlHF1QVs-cyafM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQGw7YSJea0gHYqzuunj_bwZuacpd5vQu5TBij1swUPdyA&oe=6A7B25AF"}, {"file_name": "sc5.png", "id": "167386486400512", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982562_167386489733845_2832025039911865533_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=04pUwWb_jJMQ7kNvwFFOUli&_nc_oc=AdrGRHl42vNj1rOwQQgyIUrKvAMX80E1g71aQG4Y0PidUZWwroRzhlMcnaCnLRwvdhU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQE0JebxO8SFfbnJa6146ZX5DfeZgRN48aqGrmvfa2Rh5Q&oe=6A7B2552"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "sc4.png", "id": "860094495571873", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75240101_860094502238539_6759068810652291731_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=csecNizKbqEQ7kNvwEchEjj&_nc_oc=AdqxoA8IoLkm5mX5BpeJD9ihAvSNoZ-ydYRJxHT6vbzhf8HQjfIShi3X51K5eB269wU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQE07nuq4lQ9J6WC6HcIUz0Ggu4KapRZ47wmvEnHPMIUoQ&oe=6A7B2EFD"}, "display_name": "Ball smasher", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Ball smasher aims at stress reduction. \n\nGrab any of the weapons: boxing gloves, baseball bat, sledgehammer, shovel, cricket bat, tennis bat, or your fists and smash some balls. \n\nThis unconventional method provides a physical outlet for pent-up tension, allowing individuals to release stress in a controlled environment. The variety of available tools caters to different preferences, ensuring a personalized experience. \n\nWhether you prefer the satisfying thud of a baseball bat connecting with a ball or the raw power of using your fists, the ball smasher offers a unique and cathartic way to let off steam. \n\nIt transforms the act of stress relief into a physical and engaging activity. So, the next time stress looms, head to the ball smasher and unleash your frustration on those unsuspecting balls. It's not just a stress reliever; it's a fun and dynamic approach to coping with life's pressures, promoting a healthier and more balanced mindset. \n\nTake a swing, make a hit, and feel the tension melt away as you engage in this unconventional yet effective stress-busting activity.", "short_description": "Ball smasher aims at stress reduction. \n\nGrab any of the weapons: boxing gloves, baseball bat, sledgehammer, shovel, cricket bat, tennis bat, or your fists and smash some balls. \n\nThis unconventional method provides a physical outlet for pent-up tension, allowing individuals to release stress in a controlled environment. The variety of available tools caters to different preferences, ensuring a personalized experience. "}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://artisoft.pl/policies/bs_v1.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Artisoft", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://bs.a